<title>UK: London PGMs end firmer, gold slightly up.</title>
<headline>London PGMs end firmer, gold slightly up.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALLADIUM - Strongly firmer at $175.75/$176.75 after heavy borrowing from Japan earlier. Month lease rate at 40 percent</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $7.50 at $396.50/$397.50. Following palladium.</p>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $343.50/$344.00, up 70 cents. Barely changed all day and in shadow of PGMs. Likely to remain rangebound ahead of Wednesday's OTC option expiry.</p>
<p>SILVER - Quiet and unchanged at $4.74/$4.76.</p>
</text>
